# Approved: ruling 2026-09-13.
Constant (audit 251, 0.01f): Native minimum spline velocity; Unchanged engine numerical validity check.
Constant (audit 252, 2.f): Ballistic flight-time coefficient; Physics formula, not an ability height/speed.

